    "notes": [
      "• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Kili%27s_Knowledge_VI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kili&#39;s Knowledge VI</a><br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/The_Fremennik_Trials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Fremennik Trials</a>, partially completed up to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Olaf_the_Bard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Olaf the Bard</a> segment<br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/A_Fairy_Tale_II_-_Cure_a_Queen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">A Fairy Tale II - Cure a Queen</a>, partially completed up to the abillity to access the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fairy_ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fairy ring</a> network<br>• 20 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Archaeology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Archaeology</a><br>• 80 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Attack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Attack</a> <sup>(b)</sup><br>• 80 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Magic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Magic</a> <sup>(b)</sup><br>• 90 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Necromancy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Necromancy</a><br>• 80 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Prayer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Prayer</a> <sup>(b)</sup><br>• 80 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ranged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ranged</a> <sup>(b)</sup><br>• 60 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Runecrafting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Runecrafting</a> <sup>(b)</sup>",
      "• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Pie_shell\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Pie shell</a><br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Golden_fleece\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Golden fleece</a> or 1,000 coins<br>• 25 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Greater_necroplasm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">greater necroplasm</a><br>• 10 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Crystal_key\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">crystal keys</a><br>• 50 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Impure_essence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">impure essence</a><br>• 10 damaged artefacts from <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Infernal_Source_Dig_Site\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infernal Source Dig Site</a>, of any kind, and their required materials to restore<br>• Runes to cast <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lesser_Bone_Shield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lesser</a> or <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Greater_Bone_Shield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Greater Bone Shield</a><br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Uncut_onyx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Uncut onyx</a><br>• Combat gear",
      "• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cape_of_legends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cape of legends</a> or other methods for quick access to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fairy_ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fairy ring</a> network<br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Rune_essence_pouches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rune essence pouches</a> set to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Impure_essence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">impure essence</a><br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cooking_cape\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cooking cape</a> to prevent burning the pie<br>• <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dungeoneering_cape\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dungeoneering cape</a> to resource dungeon"
    ]
  },
