          ],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "obtaining-blueberry-pie:33auwm",
          "html": "Obtain a ball of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Golden_wool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">golden wool</a> by using <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Golden_fleece\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">golden fleece</a> on a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Spinning_wheel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">spinning wheel</a>.",
          "text": "Obtain a ball of golden wool by using golden fleece on a spinning wheel.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "obtaining-blueberry-pie:33auwm:5rua03",
              "html": "Buy one from <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lalli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lalli</a> near the entrance of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fremennik_Slayer_Dungeon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fremennik Slayer Dungeon</a> (fairy ring <b>A</b><b>J</b><b>R</b>) if you don&#39;t have one.",
              "text": "Buy one from Lalli near the entrance of Fremennik Slayer Dungeon (fairy ring AJR) if you don't have one.",
