          "text": "Talk to Evil Bob three times or until you obtain the blueberries.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "obtaining-blueberry-pie:87e5ih",
          "html": "Use the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Blueberries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">blueberries</a> on a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Pie_shell\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pie shell</a> for an <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Uncooked_blueberry_pie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">uncooked blueberry pie</a>.",
