    {
      "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals",
      "title": "Obtaining powered necromancy seals",
      "anchor": "Obtaining_powered_necromancy_seals",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Killing the generals"
        },
        {
          "type": "bring",
          "needed": [
            {
              "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:bring:1vmajs",
              "html": "Combat gear of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Necromancy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Necromancy</a>",
              "text": "Combat gear of Necromancy"
            },
            {
              "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:bring:bkdyii",
              "html": "25 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Greater_necroplasm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">greater necroplasm</a>",
              "text": "25 greater necroplasm"
            },
            {
              "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:bring:bp7tn0",
              "html": "Four backpack spaces",
              "text": "Four backpack spaces"
            }
          ],
          "recommended": [
            {
              "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:bring:pyy5or",
              "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cape_of_legends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cape of legends</a> to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fairy_ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fairy ring</a>",
              "text": "Cape of legends to fairy ring"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:m3eu6e",
          "html": "Head to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Heart_of_Gielinor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Heart of Gielinor</a>.",
          "text": "Head to Heart of Gielinor.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:m3eu6e:1h6un6i",
              "html": "You may go to there by travelling to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Nardah\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Nardah</a> (fairy ring <b>D</b><b>L</b><b>Q</b>), then walk south and a little west. Alternatively, you can use a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/The_Heart_teleport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Heart teleport</a> tablet.",
              "text": "You may go to there by travelling to Nardah (fairy ring DLQ), then walk south and a little west. Alternatively, you can use a The Heart teleport tablet.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:1gaccpr",
          "html": "Kill all generals in the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Heart_of_Gielinor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Heart of Gielinor</a> with any style (doesn&#39;t have to be necromancy!) while having 25 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Greater_necroplasm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">greater necroplasm</a> in the backpack to obtain 10 of each unpowered necromancy seals. The necroplasm is not consumed. The generals will drop 1-2 unpowered seals on normal mode and 3 on hard mode.",
          "text": "Kill all generals in the Heart of Gielinor with any style (doesn't have to be necromancy!) while having 25 greater necroplasm in the backpack to obtain 10 of each unpowered necromancy seals. The necroplasm is not consumed. The generals will drop 1-2 unpowered seals on normal mode and 3 on hard mode.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:1gaccpr:ww6ew5",
              "html": "Kill <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Twin_Furies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Twin Furies</a> enough times to obtain 10 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Unpowered_necromantic_seal_of_the_Furies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">unpowered necromantic seal of the Furies</a>.",
              "text": "Kill Twin Furies enough times to obtain 10 unpowered necromantic seal of the Furies.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:1gaccpr:1kzmou2",
              "html": "Kill <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Helwyr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Helwyr</a> enough times to obtain 10 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Unpowered_necromantic_seal_of_the_Cywir\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">unpowered necromantic seal of the Cywir</a>.",
              "text": "Kill Helwyr enough times to obtain 10 unpowered necromantic seal of the Cywir.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:1gaccpr:g9mtn0",
              "html": "Kill <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Gregorovic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Gregorovic</a> enough times to obtain 10 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Unpowered_necromantic_seal_of_the_Faceless\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">unpowered necromantic seal of the Faceless</a>.",
              "text": "Kill Gregorovic enough times to obtain 10 unpowered necromantic seal of the Faceless.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:1gaccpr:5pzhpd",
              "html": "Kill <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Vindicta_%26_Gorvek\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Vindicta &amp; Gorvek</a> enough times to obtain 10 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Unpowered_necromantic_seal_of_the_Dragon_Riders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">unpowered necromantic seal of the Dragon Riders</a>.",
              "text": "Kill Vindicta & Gorvek enough times to obtain 10 unpowered necromantic seal of the Dragon Riders.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Powering the seals"
        },
        {
          "type": "bring",
          "needed": [],
          "recommended": [
            {
              "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:bring:yg80a1",
              "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Rune_essence_pouches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rune essence pouches</a> set to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Impure_essence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">impure essence</a>",
              "text": "Rune essence pouches set to impure essence"
            },
            {
              "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:bring:23zygx",
              "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dungeoneering_cape\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dungeoneering cape</a> to resource dungeon",
              "text": "Dungeoneering cape to resource dungeon"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:i9zjvk",
          "html": "(Furies) Restore ten damaged artefacts from <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Infernal_Source_Dig_Site\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infernal Source Dig Site</a> to power ten necromantic seals of the Furies.",
          "text": "(Furies) Restore ten damaged artefacts from Infernal Source Dig Site to power ten necromantic seals of the Furies.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:3auvis",
          "html": "(Cywir) Open ten <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Crystal_chest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">crystal chest</a> in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Taverley\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Taverley</a> or <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Iorwerth_Clan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Iorwerth Clan</a> in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Prifddinas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Prifddinas</a> to power ten necromantic seals of Cywir.",
          "text": "(Cywir) Open ten crystal chest in Taverley or Iorwerth Clan in Prifddinas to power ten necromantic seals of Cywir.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:xhcs9x",
          "html": "(Faceless) Craft 50 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Miasma_rune\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">miasma runes</a> to power ten necromantic seals of the Faceless. These do not need to be crafted all at once.",
          "text": "(Faceless) Craft 50 miasma runes to power ten necromantic seals of the Faceless. These do not need to be crafted all at once.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:bznb2r",
          "html": "(Dragon Riders) Absorbing <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dragonfire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">dragonfire</a> attack with either <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lesser_Bone_Shield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lesser</a> or <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Greater_Bone_Shield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Greater Bone Shield</a> active ten times or as many as possible to power ten necromantic seals of the Dragon Riders.",
          "text": "(Dragon Riders) Absorbing dragonfire attack with either Lesser or Greater Bone Shield active ten times or as many as possible to power ten necromantic seals of the Dragon Riders.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "obtaining-powered-necromancy-seals:bznb2r:1vqntgg",
              "html": "The <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Iron_dragon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">iron dragons</a> and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Steel_dragon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">steel dragons</a> in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Brimhaven_Dungeon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Brimhaven Dungeon</a> and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Brimhaven_Dungeon_resource_dungeon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Brimhaven Dungeon resource dungeon</a>, or <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Celestial_dragon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">celestial dragons</a> in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Dragontooth_Island_resource_dungeon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dragontooth Island resource dungeon</a> do work.",
              "text": "The iron dragons and steel dragons in Brimhaven Dungeon and Brimhaven Dungeon resource dungeon, or celestial dragons in Dragontooth Island resource dungeon do work.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
